title: "Cyber Trihack Challenge CTF 2026"
summary: "A CTF Colloboration between ENSIIE, APU and IQRA"
content: |
  ## Cyber Trihack Challenge CTF 2026

  A collaborative Attack & Defense CTF hosted jointly by **ENSIIE**, **APU**, and
  **IQRA**, bringing together students from all three institutions to compete
  in a live security exercise.

  ### Team Details

  - Max team size: **3 members**
  - Max containers per team: **3**

  Good luck, and happy hacking!

